# Pinotheca Frontend

Online art gallery: browse pictures, like/cart, artists, auth. Stack: Next.js 15 App Router, React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind v4, next-intl, TanStack Query, Socket.IO client.

## Agent rules

- Follow these rules strictly. If there is no clear template, ask before inventing a new pattern.
- **Ask first** before changing: auth/middleware, i18n setup/locale contract, shared UI primitives (`components/ui`).
- **Never** add comments in code.
- **Never** run git commands, create commits, or touch git config. The user handles all git.
- Default locale: `en` (also `ru`, `hy` via locale cookie + next-intl).
- Mirror closest existing feature when possible; still prefer rules over copy-paste of legacy naming.

## Required env names (values never in repo)

`NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_API_URL`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_CLIENT_URL`, `CLOUDINARY_URL`, `HOST`

## Conventions

- Component files: **PascalCase**. Folders: kebab-case. Hooks: `useX.ts`.
- Import via barrels (`@/components/ui/button`). When touching deep imports (`.../button/components`), switch to barrels.

